msgstr "一致性"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1409
msgid ""
"This section describes the conformance requirements and relationships "
"between the Python DOM API, the W3C DOM recommendations, and the OMG IDL "
"mapping for Python."
msgstr "本节描述了 Python DOM API、W3C DOM 建议以及 Python 的 OMG IDL 映射之间的一致性要求和关系。"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1417
msgid "Type Mapping"
msgstr "类型映射"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1419
msgid ""
"The IDL types used in the DOM specification are mapped to Python types "
"according to the following table."
msgstr "DOM 规范中使用的 IDL 类型将根据下表映射为 Python 类型。"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1423
msgid "IDL Type"
msgstr "IDL 类型"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1423
msgid "Python Type"
msgstr "Python 类型"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1425
msgid "``boolean``"
msgstr "``boolean``"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1425
msgid "``bool`` or ``int``"
msgstr "``bool`` 或 ``int``"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1427 ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1429
#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1431
msgid "``int``"
msgstr "``int``"

#: ../../library/xml.dom.rst:1429
